      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3 Reference Prompter test (no image)\n\nThe prompter reads the portrait, the costume and each pose with a local vision model and rewrites the short prompt into a long H3 prompt. The short prompt is kept word for word at the start; the model adds the detail after it. Roles are `auto`.\n\n**Nude** (18+ mode): the costume picture is a blank placeholder and the prompter describes the unclothed adult body. It refuses unless the portrait's estimated age is 20 or older. Never use an uploaded photo of a real person.\n\nThe three Display Text nodes show the short prompt, the H3 prompt and what the model saw."
      ]
    }
